#### ***Background***

PRAISE is an AI-enabled decision optimisation framework designed to support responsible and explainable credit strategy development.

The framework combines machine learning-driven feature discovery, rule optimisation, explainable AI validation, and embedded governance controls to generate transparent and operationally deployable decision rules.

The engine is designed to support scalable, consistent and governance-ready decisioning across risk, fraud and compliance use cases.

#### ***Purpose***

The framework is designed to:

- Identify stable and predictive risk signals from rich multi-source data
- Generate interpretable and governance-ready decision rules
- Optimise strategy trade-offs across risk, approval and customer outcomes
- Embed expert policy constraints directly into rule generation
- Support transparent, explainable and auditable decisioning workflows#### ***Core Components***

***1. AI-Driven Feature Discovery***
- Machine learning-based feature evaluation
- Stability, predictiveness and governance screening
- Explainable AI (XAI) validation

***2. Rule Strategy Optimisation***
- Automated rule construction and threshold optimisation
- Business and policy constraint integration
- Governance-ready rule recommendation generation














